      'configpesquisa.gridRaio': 'Map grid radius',
      'configpesquisa.gridRaio.hint': 'How many tiles around the aircraft are downloaded in each direction — 1 = 3×3 grid (immediate surroundings only), 10 = 21×21 grid (much wider region). Each extra unit multiplies the tiles downloaded per capture and the time/memory spent composing the image — raise it gradually and check that captures still complete without hitting PHP\'s time/memory limits.',
